Z||000013||AusFiero||07-31-2001||07:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by saleenfiero:<BR><B>Love the door skins, but man do you ever take a break?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I really wish I could. I get all jittery if I am not doing something. A true workaholic. I only sleep 3 to 5 hours a day normally and work the rest. I have been careful though after surgery. I wont push it too far. I did once, that was not fun. So now I have afternoon or early evening naps. Thats why the stage 2 side scoops are going to take 3 weeks. In full health I could have the moulds ready in 4 days. <P>But I am pretty close to being back to full health now. Just making sure I don't push it too early.<P>This project will come into fruition also, it will just take some time.<P>Now how do I put a subliminal message in here telling people to buy Stage 2 side scoops  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||14
Z||000014||AusFiero||07-31-2001||07:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Hey Aus,<BR> I really want that door / 1/4 scoop in pic 3.. Are you going to make them look just like that? Can they be installed without major mods? <BR>Thanks<BR><I>[b]Haze</I></B>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yep Haze. the other thread explains it better. But they will be bolt ons . New lower sail panel sections and half doorskin sections. I was going to just do door extensions but decided a half doorskin make life easier for people, anybody could fit them then with no major hassles. No moulding in to do. Bolt them on and paint.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000015||Cheever2||07-31-2001||08:08 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR>Now how do I put a subliminal message in here telling people to buy Stage 2 side scoops   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <HR></BLOCKQUOTE>I <B><I>knew</I></B> it!!!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P><BR>||||reg||1
